        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As enterprises scale AI on Amazon Bedrock , token spend often grows even as per-token prices fall.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/optimize-ai-economics-on-amazon-bedrock-with-accentures-sequenced-approach/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T18:48:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:56.882Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Linux Foundation has launched the Tokenomics Foundation to develop open standards for AI cost economics, a sign that managing the economics of AI is now an industry discipline.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/optimize-ai-economics-on-amazon-bedrock-with-accentures-sequenced-approach/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T18:48:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:56.882Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In this post, you will learn about six levers for optimizing token spend, how Accenture applied them in production, and how to apply them using Amazon Bedrock.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/optimize-ai-economics-on-amazon-bedrock-with-accentures-sequenced-approach/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T18:48:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:56.882Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The same levers are available natively on Amazon Bedrock as described in this post.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/optimize-ai-economics-on-amazon-bedrock-with-accentures-sequenced-approach/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T18:48:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:56.882Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This is designed to reduce cached input token costs by up to 90 percent for supported models (see Amazon Bedrock Prompt Caching ).",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/optimize-ai-economics-on-amazon-bedrock-with-accentures-sequenced-approach/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T18:48:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:56.882Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Amazon Bedrock batch inference processes non-urgent workloads asynchronously as a group at 50 percent lower cost than on-demand pricing for select models (see Amazon Bedrock Pricing ).",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/optimize-ai-economics-on-amazon-bedrock-with-accentures-sequenced-approach/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T18:48:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:56.882Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You submit inference requests as a batch job, and results are written to Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) when processing completes.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/optimize-ai-economics-on-amazon-bedrock-with-accentures-sequenced-approach/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T18:48:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:56.882Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Intelligent prompt routing can reduce costs by up to 30 percent without compromising accuracy ( see Amazon Bedrock intelligent prompt routing ).",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/optimize-ai-economics-on-amazon-bedrock-with-accentures-sequenced-approach/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T18:48:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:56.882Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Distilled models in Amazon Bedrock are up to 500 percent faster and up to 75 percent less expensive than original models, with less than 2 percent accuracy loss for use cases such as RAG.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/optimize-ai-economics-on-amazon-bedrock-with-accentures-sequenced-approach/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T18:48:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:56.882Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Third, apply Amazon Bedrock prompt caching to that workload’s interactive traffic and Amazon Bedrock batch inference to its asynchronous jobs as configuration-only changes, and measure the result before you move to architectural changes in Phase 2.",
